msgctxt "DeviceTab|"
msgid ""
"Below you can set which device Stopmotion should use for grabbing images and "
"displaying video."
msgstr ""
"A davall podeu establir el dispositiu que utilitzarà Stopmotion per a "
"capturar imatges i visualitzar vídeo."

#: src/presentation/frontends/qtfrontend/devicetab.cpp:56
#: src/presentation/frontends/qtfrontend/devicetab.cpp:343
msgctxt "DeviceTab|"
msgid ""
"You can select from the auto-detected devices below or add devices yourself. "
"It is not recommended to use devices which is not auto-detected, but feel "
"free to do it if you are an advanced user."
msgstr ""
"Podeu seleccionar a partir dels dispositius detectats automàticament davall "
"o afegir-hi dispositius. No es recomana utilitzar dispositius que no es "
"detecten automàticament, però ho podeu fer lliurement si sou un usuari "
"avançat."

